  # Shiver: burn n active energy as heat (shivering thermogenesis / muscle cold response).
  # Distinct from uncouple (pmf→heat). Yield sheds by take — free energy leaves as warmth.
  # Usability: AGI models cold-stress budgets and non-UCP heat without dual ladders.
  # Returns amount shivered. Dead/zero/empty energy → 0. Does not touch ATP/pmf/pcr.
  METHOD shiver n
    GETF THIS alive
